Blocky is a DNS proxy and ad-blocker for the local network. It filters
queries against downloadable deny and allow lists, caches and prefetches
responses, forwards selected domains to specific upstream resolvers, and
speaks DNS over TLS, HTTPS and QUIC both upstream and downstream.

This plugin manages the blocky configuration and service from the OPNsense
web interface, and adds a status page, dashboard widgets and a query log
viewer built on blocky's own statistics API.

WWW: https://github.com/0xERR0R/blocky
